<title>SUDAN: SOCCER-AL HILAL BEAT KENYA BREWERIES 5-4 ON PENALTIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AL HILAL BEAT KENYA BREWERIES 5-4 ON PENALTIES.</headline>
<dateline>KHARTOUM 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an African Champions' Cup first round second leg match on Sunday:</p>
<p>Al Hilal (Sudan)  0  Kenya Breweries (Kenya)  0 (after extra-time; first leg ended 0-0). Al Hilal won penalty shoot-out 5-4 to qualify for the second round.</p>
